  "atomic_questions": [
    "The 50 new workers that must be trained — is there a maximum number of new workers that can be in training simultaneously across the whole factory (a factory-level cap on concurrent trainees), or is the only limit the per-skilled-worker cap of 3 per two-week period?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice between two mutually exclusive constraints (factory-level cap vs. per-worker cap only), which constitutes one independent question."
}

