    "The 50 new workers that must be trained by the end of week 8 — is there a minimum number of new workers that must be trained in each individual two-week period, or can all 50 be trained in a single two-week period (e.g., weeks 7-8) as long as enough skilled workers are available?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response asks for a single policy choice regarding the distribution of training across periods, which constitutes one semantically independent question."
